/**
 * The artwork for เชฟชังชังเปิดร้าน, carried in the document.
 *
 * BASE64, one long line each, for the reason `waste-sort-buddy.ts` gives at
 * length: the game is a string handed to a WebView, a WebView given bare HTML
 * has no origin, and so `menu-1.png` resolves against nothing. `mini-games.test`
 * holds every game to it - no http, no CDN, no img that is not a data URI -
 * because a game that fetches is a game that fails on the ferry, and because a
 * page that reaches out tells somebody that this person played this game.
 *
 * webp at 680-760px and quality 62-80, from the drawings delivered on
 * 13 November. Big enough for the card the game draws them in, small enough
 * that six of them are 400 KB rather than two megabytes.
 *
 * DISH_4 is not a photograph of the dish. There was no photograph of the crab
 * ice cream among the artwork - only ชังชัง holding one - so that is what it
 * is, and the dish says so in its own note rather than passing a mascot
 * drawing off as the product.
 */

